  m_text: 'Instructions:


    Sail the seas to collect pieces to the long lost hamster toy. Avoid danger and work quickly. If you hit the wrong item, you''ll run out of time faster! Once you''ve collected the three unique pieces, try your luck to see if you can build it in time.


    WASD/Arrow Keys to navigate boat

    Left Shift to speed up

    Mouse click buttons when prompted '
